            <p class="chat-tip">支持大田病害成因诊断 · 药剂配方推荐 · 植保无人机飞防参数指导</p>
          </div>
        </SpotlightCard>

        <!-- 10. Environmental Micro-Climate Telemetry Card -->
        <SpotlightCard className="env-spotlight-card" spotlightColor="rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.08)">
          <div class="card-head">
            <div>
              <h2 class="section-title">4号试验田微环境物联遥测</h2>
              <p class="section-desc">LoRa 传感器阵列 · 采样频率 5min/次</p>
            </div>
            <span class="env-update-pill">⛅ 实时传输中</span>
          </div>

          <div class="env-grid">
            <div class="env-item">
              <span class="env-icon">🌡️</span>
              <div class="env-info">
